  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You possess specific job skills and keep them honed. When you gain this talent, you gain ranks in a single Artistry or Profession skill of your choice equal to your total Hit Dice; whenever you gain a permanent Hit Die (generally, when you gain a level) you gain an additional rank. If you already possess ranks in the chosen skill, you may immediately retrain them. You do not get to retrain when temporarily gaining this talent. You unlock skill leverage with this skill.</p>\n<p>You can take this talent multiple times, choosing a different skill each time.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/vocation#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
